  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["hey, just looking around?", "ye seeing whats here"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["know what rune scims go for atm?", "prices move, id ask around a bit"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["what are u saving for?", "probably a better weapon"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["u reckon its worth buying a full set?", "try pricing the bits first"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["anyone selling stuff round here?", "prob, give it a minute"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["hows the merching today?", "takes some patience lol"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["what stocks up fast in ur bank?", "random stuff i swear i'll use later"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["do u come here to buy stuff often?", "only if i need something"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["do u keep spare food in the bank?", "yeah, always seems to come in handy"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["think i should sell my logs later", "check what ppl are paying first"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["how do u read prices when its busy?", "look for the item first then the gp"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["dunno if i should buy supplies yet", "wait till u know how many you need"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["what are u going to buy next?", "something i can actually use"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["can never find anything in my bank", "put ur usual gear together"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["someone always has a cheaper offer later", "thats why i never buy the first one"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["should i sell it all at once?", "try a stack first if ur unsure on price"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["ever buy more than u came for?", "yeah especially if im just looking"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["wonder if its worth buying an addy axe", "if u can use it and ur gonna wc"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["got to save some gp for later", "always something else to spend it on"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["anyone hang about here just to chat?", "yeah, im taking a break"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["whats good to keep for training?", "a bit of food and some tele runes"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["which armour would u save for?", "rune eventually"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["wonder what a glory costs today", "ask around before you buy one"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["hello :)", "hey, hows it going?"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["anything worth checking the price of?", "check the gear you're saving for"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["might do a quest after this", "get what u need while ur here"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["do price checks take long?", "usually just got to ask a few ppl"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["its easy to lose track of gp here", "pick a price before you start looking"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["trying to save instead of buy this time", "gl, same here"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["did u ever finish ur first rune set?", "took a while but yeah"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["what do you do with old armour?", "bank it or sell it to pay for the next set"]
