  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["ever try reading all the prices at once?", "nah i pick one thing to look for"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["how do u catch what someone's selling?", "look for the item name as it goes by"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["too many ppl typing when its busy", "move a bit closer to whoever u want"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["what does 30 ea mean again?", "30 coins per item"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["how do u tell who's buying what?", "look for buying or selling at the start"]
  },
  {
