  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["who sets what an item goes for?", "whatever a buyer and seller agree to"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["i dont know how long to wait for a seller", "depends how badly u need it"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["nice when someone has exactly what u need", "saves walking round asking everyone"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["should i wait till its busier to sell?", "might get more offers if u do"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["ever take the first offer?", "if its a price im alright with"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["can u find cheaper stuff in a shop?", "sometimes. worth checking on the way"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["how can u tell if an item is worth the trouble selling?", "see if ppl actually ask for it"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["do u ever sell gear to upgrade?", "sometimes if i wont use it again"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["worth keeping my old shield?", "keep it if u need a spare"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["is it worth buying trim when ur skint?", "id get the useful bits first"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["do u buy armour one piece at a time?", "depends what the set goes for"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["my gp lasts longer when i only look", "same till someone has something i want"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["should i get a weapon or armour next?", "weapon if ur old one takes forever to kill things"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["what do u reckon i should buy for skilling?", "supplies for whatever ur gonna train"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["any point getting a tool before u have the lvl?", "only if its cheap and ur nearly there"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["worth buying an axe and a pick together?", "if u need both, sure"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["do u keep basic gear for quests?", "yeah never know what theyll ask u to wear"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["i always end up looking at stuff i cant use yet", "gives u an idea what to save up for"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["what if i only have a little gp?", "stick to the stuff u know youll use"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["could do with sorting the junk from my bank", "sell it if u havent used it in ages"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["do u keep coins next to ur gear in bank?", "i like having them where i can find em"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["how do u decide what to take out first?", "check what u need for the trip"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["u ever get to the bank and forget why?", "yeah that usually means i needed food"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["i keep too many bits from quests", "same, some of it might be useful later"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["which runes do u keep handy in bank?", "the tele ones if ive got em"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["wheres a decent place to buy supplies?", "try where people bank the stuff they gather"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["ever sell stuff straight after training?", "at the bank if someones buying"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["u buy logs or cut ur own?", "cut em if ive got time"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["any reason to buy raw fish instead of cooked?", "if you want the cooking xp"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["is it worth buying runes in small amounts?", "sure if thats all u can afford"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["do u ask for a whole load or price each?", "price each, then work out what i want"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["can i buy a little first and come back?", "sure if the seller's going to be here"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["how u split stuff when its noted?", "pick the amount you want to offer"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["what do u check on the trade screen?", "amount and item, then check em again"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["u ever see someone change the amount at the end?", "yeah thats why i read the second screen"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["who do u ask if the price sounds wrong?", "someone who buys the item a lot"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["would u wait here long just to find one thing?", "if i couldnt get it anywhere else"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["got any plans once ur done here?", "depends what supplies i can get"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["i always end up standing here longer than i mean to", "easy when theres people to talk to"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["taking a break from clicking stuff for a bit", "yeah, nice to just chat sometimes"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["hard to tell who i'm trying to trade when its busy", "right click and check the name"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["hi mate u buying or just looking?", "just looking for now"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["oh hi, didnt see u there", "hey :)"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["u know a better spot to read chat?", "try the edge where fewer ppl are standing"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["why do i always come with no spare gp?", "probably because of the last thing u bought"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["BANK"],
    "lines": ["when do u stop looking for a deal?", "when i would rather go do something else"]
  }
]
